    /// Shifts every element right by `rhs` bits (a division by `2^rhs`).
    ///
    /// Mirrors `impl Shr<u32> for glam::UVec2`.
    /// #### Panics
    /// * `'UVec2: shift overflow'` if `rhs >= 32` (Rust: overflow panic in debug builds,
